<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY THREE-MTH T-BILL YIELD DROPS TO 20.26 PCT.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY THREE-MTH T-BILL YIELD DROPS TO 20.26 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on</p>
<p>Hungary's three-month discount Treasury bills was set by</p>
<p>auction at 20.26 percent, down from 20.47 percent set at an</p>
<p>auction one week ago, the Government Debt Management Centre</p>
<p>said.</p>
<p>    Total on offer	     5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received     14,073.28 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	    5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		 5,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    20.26 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		     95.1917 pct</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327 4040</p>
</text>
